cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying article."
title: "MCDD"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of manifold-constrained dynamic decoupling (MCDD)
  learning for unsupervised multiclass anomaly detection. A frozen encoder
  provides multiscale normal features, the cross-hierarchy attentive bottleneck
  builds a hybrid-scale base manifold, and a hybrid perception reasoning
  decoder with noise-augmented feature expansion reconstructs normal patterns
  for pixelwise anomaly localization.
